(iii) Review the grievances received from MSEs regarding Government procurement, including imposition of unreasonable conditions in the tenders floated by the Government Departments/PSUs: and (iv) Suggest special measures to be taken by the Central Ministries/Departments for enhancing their procurements from MSEs.

